/Title (A clear-eyed and regionally nuanced view of the war should therefore guide capital allocation. Money is still moving toward the diversified hubs: the UAE continues to attract corporate relocations, DIFC convenes global finance in September, and the Dubai investment-summit circuit remains busy. The monetary-stability case for the Gulf is intact, but it is no longer uniform. It is strongest where the economy is least exposed to a single chokepoint, and thinnest where hydrocarbons still need to cross the Strait to keep the economy afloat.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 396 0 R
/Next 401 0 R
>>
